<main id="main" class="page detail-page" style="--pokemon-color:<?= e(preg_match('/^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/i', $pokemon['color']) ? $pokemon['color'] : '#3bbfc9') ?>">
<a class="back-link" href="<?= e(route()) ?>#catalog">← Voltar à Pokédex</a>
<section class="detail-hero role-<?= e($pokemon['stats_battle'][0]) ?>"><div class="detail-art type-<?= e($pokemon['types'][0]) ?>" data-motion-target><div class="detail-ring"></div><img src="<?= e(img('stat/stat-' . $pokemon['avatar'] . '.png')) ?>" alt="<?= e($pokemon['name']) ?>"></div><div class="detail-copy"><span class="detail-id">Nº <?= e(str_pad($pokemon['national_id'] ?? $pokemon['id'], 3, '0', STR_PAD_LEFT)) ?></span><h1><?= e($pokemon['name']) ?></h1><div class="detail-types"><?php foreach ($pokemon['types'] as $type): ?><span class="type-pill type-<?= e($type) ?>"><?= e(type_labels()[$type]) ?></span><?php endforeach ?></div><div class="detail-badges"><span class="role-badge"><?= e(role_label($pokemon['stats_battle'][0])) ?></span><span><?= e(level_label($pokemon['level'])) ?></span><span><?= $pokemon['stats_battle'][1] === 'Melee' ? 'Corpo a corpo' : 'Longo alcance' ?></span></div><p><?= e($pokemon['description']) ?></p><a class="button button-dark" href="<?= e(route('team', ['element'=>$pokemon['types'][0], 'pick'=>$pokemon['id']])) ?>#catalog"><?= icon('team') ?> Escalar no montador</a><button class="text-link detail-animate" data-animate="<?= e($pokemon['id']) ?>"><?= icon('spark') ?> Animar Pokémon</button></div></section>
<div class="detail-sections"><section class="stats-section"><h2>Por dentro da batalha.</h2><p>Características do catálogo Unite.</p><div class="stat-list"><?php foreach (['attack'=>'Ataque','resistance'=>'Resistência','mobility'=>'Mobilidade','punctuation'=>'Pontuação','support'=>'Apoio'] as $key=>$label): $max=$key==='mobility'?10:100; ?><div class="stat-row"><div><label for="stat-<?= e($key) ?>"><?= e($label) ?></label><span><?= e($pokemon['skills'][$key]) ?> / <?= $max ?></span></div><progress id="stat-<?= e($key) ?>" max="<?= $max ?>" value="<?= e($pokemon['skills'][$key]) ?>"><?= e($pokemon['skills'][$key]) ?></progress></div><?php endforeach ?></div><small>Mobilidade é exibida na escala 0–10 do arquivo original; demais atributos, 0–100. Não são dados competitivos em tempo real.</small></section><section class="evolution-section"><h2>Uma jornada de evolução.</h2><p>Cada fase faz parte da história.</p><div class="evolution-list"><?php if (!$pokemon['evolutions']): ?><div class="no-evolution"><?= icon('spark') ?><p>A linha evolutiva ainda não foi cadastrada nesta ficha.</p></div><?php else: foreach ($pokemon['evolutions'] as $ev): ?><div class="evolution"><img src="<?= e(img('evolution/' . basename($ev['avatar']))) ?>" alt="<?= e($ev['name']) ?>"><strong><?= e(mb_convert_case($ev['name'], MB_CASE_TITLE, 'UTF-8')) ?></strong><span><?= $ev['level'] ? 'Nível ' . e($ev['level']) : 'Forma alternativa' ?></span></div><?php endforeach; endif ?></div></section></div>
<section class="moves-section"><h2>Um repertório para descobrir.</h2><p>Movimentos dos jogos principais, em seus nomes originais. Clique em um golpe para movimentar o Pokémon.</p><div class="move-list"><?php foreach ($pokemon['moves'] as $move): ?><button class="move-button" data-animate="<?= e($pokemon['id']) ?>"><?= icon('bolt') ?> <?= e($move['name']) ?></button><?php endforeach ?></div><small>Fonte: PokéAPI. Estes golpes não representam o conjunto de movimentos de Pokémon Unite.</small></section>
</main>
